## Diff reviewed (git diff 258f058 -- web/static/js/insights.js)
Confirmed the change is confined to: (1) a new themedTrendPayload() helper
that applies current-theme markers to a filtered copy without mutating
trendsChartRaw; (2) the `themechange` listener now calls renderTrendsChart()
(full re-render) instead of Plotly.restyle(marker); (3) Insights tab
activation (activateInsightsTab) now calls renderTrendsChart() when
trendsChartRaw is populated, falling back to Plotly.Plots.resize() only
when no data has been fetched yet. No template/markup changes; no new DOM
nodes, ARIA, or CSS.

